{"TALK_BUSY_COMBAT","",{"Not now!","Get clear! We can talk later!","I can't hear you over this! Move!","Not a good time for a conversation!","Ask me when I'm not trying to stay alive!","I can't listen to you right now!","This can wait, can't it?","Let me deal with this first!","I need my attention elsewhere!","Please, not while this is happening!","I heard you. Later!","You picked one hell of a time to chat!","Let me survive this, then ask!","Can't think about that now!","Talking isn't helping me at the moment!","Save it until I can hear myself!","A little busy! You might have noticed!","You wanna talk NOW?!","Wait! Just-- WAIT!","Are you serious? Look around!","Heard you! Can't answer!","Later, okay? Fucking later!","Can you not? I'm trying to stay alive!","Not ignoring you! Trying not to get killed!","If this can wait, let it fucking wait!","Not a word of that went in - ask after!","I can't do both! Stop asking!","You've picked a hell of a time!","Can't look at you - don't come round in front!","Ask me again after this, I'm gonna forget!","I heard something, couldn't tell you what!","Hang on! Hang on, goddammit!","Not a good time, really not a good time!","Talk somewhere we aren't getting killed!","I wanna hear it - I do, but not here!","Oh, for-- can you just WAIT?!"}},
{"TALK_BUSY_COMBAT","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh",{"Please, get back! I can't watch you too!"}},
{"TALK_BUSY_COMBAT","reg=law,swat,military,elite",{"Stay out of my line of fire!"}},
{"TALK_BUSY_COMBAT","tmp=fresh",{"Don't-- don't make me look away!","I DON'T KNOW! I don't even know what I'm doing!","What? What do you WANT?!","After! Please, just let me get through this!","I can't... I can't catch my breath!","Stay back! My hands are all-- stay back!","Sorry! Sorry, I can't listen!","I need a second! Not a question, a second!","I've never done this before, okay?!","Please stop talking, please - I can't--","Too much! You're giving me too much!","Can it wait? Tell me it can wait!","I'm TRYING! Stop yelling at me!","I can't even hear myself think!","Ask me again when this stops, I can't think!","I know you're there! Please don't make me turn around!","I'm not being rude! I'm fucking terrified!","Huh?! No, I didn't hear you!","Don't ask me to make another decision right now!","Yes! No! I don't fucking know, leave it!"}},
{"TALK_BUSY_COMBAT","tmp=seasoned",{"Hold that thought, got my hands full","Can't turn around - tell me after","Busy, very fucking busy","Not now, and don't ask again till this is over","Get clear first, we can talk there","Quiet a second, need to hear","Is it urgent? No? Then later","Lost you after the first word - save it","Catch me after, you can see I'm busy","Not having this discussion here"}},
{"TALK_BUSY_COMBAT","tmp=veteran",{"Right after a fight - keep clear","Stop talking, stay clear","I need that space - talk later","Unless that's a warning, hold it","Talk when we're clear","Heard you - hold on","Give me room, back up","Can't talk - keep your head down","Not now, eyes up","Unless you've got eyes on something, quiet"}},
{"TALK_BUSY_COMBAT","tmp=predator",{"Do I look available for a fucking interview?","Keep bothering me, see how that ends","Move your ass - talk later","Not dying over your stupid fucking question","Find somebody else to annoy while I'm busy"}},
