{"TALK_GREET_OPEN","reg=civilian,family|st=friendly,neutral",{"Oh, hey, what's up?","Oh hey! Didn't see you there - what's going on?","Hm? Oh, hi - something wrong?","Hey there, you need something?","Oh, hi - sorry, I was miles away - what's up?","Hey, you good? Need something?"}},
{"TALK_GREET_OPEN","reg=worker|st=friendly,neutral",{"Hey, what's up?","Yeah? Make it quick, I've got work to finish","Oh hey, need a hand with something?","Hey, friend, what's on your mind?","Hm? Oh, yeah, go ahead, I'm listening","Hey, what's up? Everything okay out there?"}},
{"TALK_GREET_OPEN","reg=rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"Oh hey, everything alright? Anybody hurt?","Hello - what's up? Do you need anything?","Hey, hold on, I'm listening - what's the matter?","Hi there - are you okay? What's up?","Hey. You need me?","Hey, you look like you've got something on your mind - what's up?"}},
{"TALK_GREET_OPEN","reg=law,swat|st=friendly,neutral",{"Yeah? What's up?","Hey, easy does it - what do you need?","I'm listening - what's going on?","Hold up a second - what's the matter?","Hey there, something I can help with?","All right - what's up?"}},
{"TALK_GREET_OPEN","reg=military,elite|st=friendly,neutral",{"Yeah, go ahead","At ease - what do you need?","Go ahead - I'm listening","Hold on - what's going on?","State your business, friendly, I hope","Hey, keep it short - what's up?"}},
{"TALK_GREET_OPEN","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=friendly,neutral",{"What?","Yeah? What's up with you?","Hey, you want something?","Alright, you got my attention. What is it?","Easy, I'm listening - what do you want?","Hm, talk"}},
{"TALK_GREET_OPEN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"Oh! Hi, sorry, hi, you wanted to talk? Okay, okay, I'm listening","Huh? Oh... yes, I'm listening","You're talking to me, great, great, what do you want to talk about?"}},
